      "name": "Top Navigation Bar",
      "role": "Sticky header with primary nav",
      "description": "Transparent parchment background, 1px bottom border in #dbd7da. Center-aligned HEX wordmark in PP Formula at 24px. Nav links in IBM Plex Sans 500 at 14px, #31263b. Right side: 'Log in' ghost link + outlined 'Get started' button (3px radius, Plum Charcoal border). No background blur, no shadow — the nav is a flat hairline above the canvas."
    },
    {
      "name": "Logo Trust Bar",
      "role": "Social proof row below the hero",
      "description": "Two rows of customer logos in monochrome black or near-black, 24px column gap, centered. Small caps label 'TRUSTED BY LEADING DATA COMPANIES' in IBM Plex Sans 600 at 11px, #89828d, letter-spaced +0.08em. Logos are not recolored to brand — they sit in their native grays, treated as content rather than UI."
