      "name": "AI Agent Chat Panel",
      "role": "Conversational interface preview in product cards",
      "description": "White fill, 6px top-left radius, sits flush right inside the notebook card. Header: 'NexaCorp product line performance (Q3)' in IBM Plex Sans 600 at 14px, #01011b. Share / Continue in project link buttons in #717a94. Agent messages in IBM Plex Sans 400 at 13px, #31263b, with a small avatar circle (20px, Plum Charcoal fill) and 'Thought for 11 seconds' timestamp in #89828d. Input field at bottom: 1px border in #dbd7da, 6px radius, IBM Plex Sans 400 placeholder at 13px in #89828d."
