      "role": "Text-left / product-right feature sections",
      "description": "Max-width 1200px, 80px vertical gap between sections. Left column: 40% width, contains a pill eyebrow badge, 60px PP Formula SemiExtended heading, 20px IBM Plex Sans body in #43394c, and a ghost outlined button. Right column: 60% width, contains a Notebook Product Card. Alternates left/right by section."
    },
